Split Prompt (Condensed) Role. You are a professional robot manipulation video analysis expert. Goal. Split a video into
continuous, non-overlapping atomic subtasks. The input video is
sampled at 2 fps, with 0.5 seconds between consecutive frames. The overall task is: task_name . Workflow. 1. Watch the complete video and identify every meaningful atomic action in
chronological order. 2. Split by action intent. 3. Ensure that subtasks are sequential, with no overlap or gap. 4. Name objects accurately. Output. Output standardized JSON containing the description, start time, and end time of every subtask. [
  {
    "description": "subtask description",
    "start_time": 0.500,
    "end_time": 2.500
  }
]
